    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zkjxx8a",
      "content": "The Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC) is a constitutional body established under Article 315 of the Constitution of India. It is responsible for recruitment to various state services and advising the government on service matters. The MPPSC headquarters is located at Indore. The Chairman and members of MPPSC are appointed by the Governor of MP."
    },
